091 kv-skip-unit-scale: skip the divide-by-1.0 on the fp8 KV write

SWAKVPool.set_kv_buffer defaults k_scale / v_scale to the float 1.0 (not None) and forwards them to
MHATokenToKVPool.set_kv_buffer, which then runs cache_k.div_(1.0) / cache_v.div_(1.0) before the
fp8 cast: two no-op elementwise launches per attention layer per step on every hybrid-SWA preset
with an fp8 KV pool (98 per Flint step). Skip the divide when the scale is the Python float 1.0
(bit-exact). SGLANG_KV_SKIP_UNIT_SCALE=0 restores the unconditional divide.
flint plain tripwire, two interleaved boots per arm: 200.4 / 186.2 / 134.8 and 201.2 / 186.2 / 135.0
-> 204.5 / 189.4 / 136.8 and 206.2 / 190.5 / 137.0 tok/s at 1K / 32K / 262K. Flint spec cycle at
241K unchanged (13.18 / 13.19 -> 13.17 ms; Mul launches 100 -> 2 per cycle).
---
diff --git a/python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/memory_pool.py b/python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/memory_pool.py
index f6d0b71ae3..22eb7663e1 100644
--- a/python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/memory_pool.py
+++ b/python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/memory_pool.py
@@ -107,6 +107,9 @@ if TYPE_CHECKING:
 
 logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)
 
+# SGLANG_KV_SKIP_UNIT_SCALE=0 restores the unconditional fp8 KV scale divide.
+_SKIP_UNIT_KV_SCALE = os.environ.get("SGLANG_KV_SKIP_UNIT_SCALE", "1") != "0"
+
 # Debug-only invariant in the Mamba slot-donation path calls tensor.item(), which
 # forces a per-request cudaStreamSynchronize on the scheduler thread and can stall
 # the scheduler under load. Off by default; set SGLANG_MAMBA_DEBUG_ASSERTS=1 to
@@ -2924,9 +2927,10 @@ class MHATokenToKVPool(KVCache):
             return
 
         if cache_k.dtype != self.dtype:
-            if k_scale is not None:
+            # SWAKVPool forwards a default scale of exactly 1.0: skip the divide-by-one launch.
+            if k_scale is not None and not (_SKIP_UNIT_KV_SCALE and type(k_scale) is float and k_scale == 1.0):
                 cache_k.div_(k_scale)
-            if v_scale is not None:
+            if v_scale is not None and not (_SKIP_UNIT_KV_SCALE and type(v_scale) is float and v_scale == 1.0):
                 cache_v.div_(v_scale)
             cache_k = cache_k.to(self.dtype)
             cache_v = cache_v.to(self.dtype)
